केचिद्भ‍ीता: प्राञ्जलयो गृणन्ति ।
स्वस्तीत्युक्त्वा महर्षिसिद्धसङ्घा:
स्तुवन्ति त्वां स्तुतिभि: पुष्कलाभि: ॥ २१ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":3247,\"bb\":2865,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/11/21/b2865/\",\"body_value\":\"amī hi tvāṁ sura-saṅghā viśanti
kecid bhītāḥ prāñjalayo gṛṇanti
svastīty uktvā maharṣi-siddha-saṅghāḥ
stuvanti tvāṁ stutibhiḥ puṣkalābhiḥ\"}]},{\"section\":\"synonyms\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.synonyms\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"books.Synonyms\",\"title\":\"synonyms\",\"id\":3248,\"bb\":2866,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/11/21/b2866/\",\"shadow_value\":\"amī – all those; hi – certainly; tvām – You; sura-saṅghāḥ – groups of demigods; viśanti – are entering; kecit – some of them; bhītāḥ – out of fear; prāñjalayaḥ – with folded hands; gṛṇanti – are offering prayers; svasti – all peace; iti – thus; uktvā – speaking; mahā-ṛṣi – great sages; siddha-saṅghāḥ – perfect beings; stuvanti – are singing hymns; tvām – unto You; stutibhiḥ – with prayers; puṣkalābhiḥ – Vedic hymns.\",\"word_for_word_value\":[{\"word\":\"amī\",\"translation\":\"all those\"},{\"word\":\"hi\",\"translation\":\"certainly\"},{\"word\":\"tvām\",\"translation\":\"You\"},{\"word\":\"sura-saṅghāḥ\",\"translation\":\"groups of demigods\"},{\"word\":\"viśanti\",\"translation\":\"are entering\"},{\"word\":\"kecit\",\"translation\":\"some of them\"},{\"word\":\"bhītāḥ\",\"translation\":\"out of fear\"},{\"word\":\"prāñjalayaḥ\",\"translation\":\"with folded hands\"},{\"word\":\"gṛṇanti\",\"translation\":\"are offering prayers\"},{\"word\":\"svasti\",\"translation\":\"all peace\"},{\"word\":\"iti\",\"translation\":\"thus\"},{\"word\":\"uktvā\",\"translation\":\"speaking\"},{\"word\":\"mahā-ṛṣi\",\"translation\":\"great sages\"},{\"word\":\"siddha-saṅghāḥ\",\"translation\":\"perfect beings\"},{\"word\":\"stuvanti\",\"translation\":\"are singing hymns\"},{\"word\":\"tvām\",\"translation\":\"unto You\"},{\"word\":\"stutibhiḥ\",\"translation\":\"with prayers\"},{\"word\":\"puṣkalābhiḥ\",\"translation\":\"Vedic hymns\"}]}]},{\"section\":\"translation\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.translation\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"translation\",\"id\":3249,\"bb\":2867,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/11/21/b2867/\",\"body_value\":\"All the hosts of demigods are surrendering before You and entering into You. Some of them, very much afraid, are offering prayers with folded hands. Hosts of great sages and perfected beings, crying “All peace!” are praying to You by singing the Vedic hymns.\"}]},{\"section\":\"purport\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.purport\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"paragraph\",\"id\":3250,\"bb\":2868,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/11/21/b2868/\",\"body_value\":\"The demigods in all the planetary systems feared the terrific manifestation of the universal form and its glaring effulgence and so prayed for protection.\"}]}],\"short_title\":\"Bg. 11.21\",\"medium_title\":\"Bhagavad-gītā As It Is 11.21\"},\"locale\":\"en\",\"activeView\":\"$6:props:activeView\"}]}],\"$L25\",\"$L26\",\"$L27\"]}]\n"])self.__next_f.push([1,"29:I[83068,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n2f:I[78455,[\"/_next/static/chunks/130enlymdm.jk.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0b6f_zxj9ay~6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/143cg6c13uly6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/07vk.k35-e~ti.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0j6k6n9cniknh.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0.zxv9arc6a56.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/00-zmo-3n1bt8.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/0p4z5tusn0jt6.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/01mcazkjru_is.js\"],\"default\"]\n25:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"px-4 py-4 w-full max-w-screen-xl mx-auto md:px-8 mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Breadcrumb\",\"className\":\"breadcrumb mb-8 text-base\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"ol\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"/en/library/\",{\"className\":\"inline\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L20\",null,{\"href\":\"/en/library/\",\"className\":\"text-vb-link\",\"c